# Blackwell (SM100) benchmark wheel dependency for the DeepGEMM baseline.
# FlashInfer and FlashAttention are no longer mirrored here: upstream publishes
# both as pure-Python JIT wheels, so they come from the pip lock instead
# (`flashinfer-python`, `flash-attn-4`).
# This wheel is pre-built on a B200 machine and uploaded via:
#   ./utils/upload-public-bazel-artifact.sh <name> sm100 <wheel_path>
# To rebuild it, run --build-wheels on
# max/kernels/benchmarks/misc/comparison/setup_bench_env.py
# NOTE: Filename has '+' replaced with '_' to avoid S3 URL encoding issues.
# The '+' in PEP 440 local versions (e.g., 2.2.0+38f8ef7) requires URL encoding
# as %2B, but Bazel's http_file doesn't encode, causing 403 errors.
# setup_bench_env.py --build-wheels automatically sanitizes filenames.
